      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DUNCAN.\nTrue, worthy Banquo! He is full so valiant;\nAnd in his commendations I am fed.\nIt is a banquet to me. Let’s after him,\nWhose care is gone before to bid us welcome:\nIt is a peerless kinsman.",
